		</li>
		<li>
			Developed content editors in SvelteKit as a lightweight CMS with
			extensible, reusable post types
		</li>
		<li>
			Implemented sales dashboard and payments infrastructure: Stripe, creator
			payouts, Web3 support
		</li>
		<li>
			Managed GCP microservices; monitored errors with Sentry, logs with
			ElasticSearch
		</li>
	</ExperienceItem>

	<ExperienceItem
		title="Grant for the Web - Technical Scholar"
		duration={['Aug 2020', 'Apr 2021']}
		time="34w"
	>
		<li>
			Built a native Web Monetization prototype in Firefox, shaping the WICG
			spec
		</li>
		<li>
			Picked up Gecko's C++ codebase to work across the core browser engine and
			the extensions API
		</li>
	</ExperienceItem>

	<ExperienceItem
		title="Mozilla Open Source Support (MOSS) Program"
		duration={['May 2020', 'Jul 2020']}
		time="13w"
	>
		<li>
			Core maintainer of ReSpec, the publication system used to author W3C
			standards
		</li>
		<li>
			Shipped new features, performant APIs, improved CLI, overhauled the
			project's documentation
		</li>
	</ExperienceItem>

	<ExperienceItem
		title="Chegg - Software Development Engineer Intern"
		duration={['Jan 2019', 'Jul 2019']}
		time="26w"
	>
		<li>
			Built UI for Chegg Prep and internal tools spanning ticket automation,
			LDAP, and API integrations
		</li>
		<li>Improved CheggIndia.com's performance (from 4s load to 200ms)</li>
	</ExperienceItem>

	<ExperienceItem
		title="Mozilla - Google Summer of Code"
		duration={['May 2018', 'Aug 2018']}
		time="16w"
	>
		<li>
			Developed new features in ReSpec, focused on UX, automation, and
			maintainability
		</li>
		<li>
			Implemented automatic cross-referencing capability, now extensively used
			by W3C specifications
		</li>
	</ExperienceItem>
